All icon artwork in this repository (the Xara originals, the SVG
conversions, and the PNG renders) was drawn by David Rutten and is
distributed by Robert McNeel & Associates. His stated terms, from the
official guide page
(https://developer.rhino3d.com/guides/grasshopper/grasshopper-icons/):

    "You are free to use and modify these vector graphics for any
    project, document or webpage that is associated with Grasshopper.
    You do not need to credit me, though it is not allowed to pass the
    work off as your own without modifications."

Those terms govern everything here. The conversions and renders in this
repository are format translations of his work, not original artwork, and
claim no rights of their own.
